title: NPC1
---
Kid: Hey, you!
Kid: What took you so long? 
Kid: I've got my tickets. I wanna get a prize.
 -> Okay, okay...
 <<start_prizes>>
 Kid: Thanks!
<<deactivate_npc NPCManager>>

