title: Buyer
---
???: You work here?
???: Ah, clearly you don't hold much power here.
???: Is there a manager I could talk to?
    -> No.
        ???: Here's my number. Tell them to give me a call.
        ???: I'm looking to purchase this building.
        ???: Already closing some deals on a few others nearby.
    -> Why?
        ???: Looking to buy this building.
        ???: Already working on some of the others.
        ???: It's got great bones. And, well, it doesn't exactly look like business is booming.
        ???: We've got great business ideas. It'll do this town some good. Bring the tourists back.
            -> What would you know about what's good for this town?
            ???: No offense, but more than you.
            ???: Anyways. Tell your boss to give me a call.
            ???: I'll be back either way.            


